# Tasks are the automation half of KafScript: register this on the "Tasks & Checks" screen (or via
# AutomationScheduler in code) and it runs on its own schedule, independent of the interactive
# Script Editor's "Run all" button.

Task: Heartbeat producer
schedule every 5 minutes
Given use connection "local"
When produce message to topic "heartbeats" value "ping"

Task: Nightly DLQ sweep
schedule at 2:00
Given use connection "local"
Then scan topic "orders-dlq" from beginning limit 500
And acknowledge each scanned message
